# Tamiyo, Collector of Tales: spells and abilities Bot2 controls can't cause Bot1 to discard (CR 101.2), so Hymn to
# Tourach takes nothing from Bot1's hand. Her +1 names Lightning Bolt and reveals the top four cards: both Bolts go to the
# hand, the rest to the graveyard, together. Her -3 then returns the Mountain from the graveyard to Bot1's hand.
